<item>
 <title>Town House Farm</title>
 <link>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/general/town-house-farm</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;We are not (yet) residents of Mathon but are interested in Town House Farm which is being auctioned at the end of July. This seems like a beautiful set of buildings which are worthy of restoration. We would like to hear from anyone with any local knowledge of the history of the farm, especially the fire which must have occurred in the barn immediately to the rear of the farmhouse. Does anyone have any old photographs? We would like to know what the original windows were like. Neil and Judith Walker.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
